  <!-- EN: smuggler's den -->
  <BTG_SmugglersDen.label>走私巢穴</BTG_SmugglersDen.label>
  <!-- EN: An orbital platform seized by Salvagers, used as a smuggling hub and black market outpost.

These platforms have long-range automatic weapon systems capable of destroying incoming ships. They can only safely be approached by a gravship with a signal jammer. -->
  <BTG_SmugglersDen.description>一座被打撈者佔據的軌道平台，用作走私樞紐與黑市前哨站。\n\n這些平台擁有長程自動武器系統，可以摧毀進入的飛船。只有裝有信號干擾器的重力船才能安全靠近。</BTG_SmugglersDen.description>
  <!-- Vanilla zh-Hant approach strings carry no trailing 。 (Odyssey: 調查{0}). -->
